# 📊 The Creative Matrix Framework

## Executive Overview & Core Architecture

The Creative Matrix operates without predictive modeling. It relies on a three-tier architecture: a **labeling system**, a **scoring rule**, and a **gap-selection heuristic**. Its primary purpose is to visualize creative coverage, identify fatigue risks, and highlight high-probability hypotheses for future testing.
